# gic_auroral.te — GIC-Breitenband-Familie auroral (|CGM| >= 60 Grad): der Stufe-1-Screen
#   ueber die 31 Stationen des Bandes. Die Bandzugehoerigkeit ist eine deklarierte Ableitung
#   aus `cgm_lat` (phi/sources.φ, per Station) und den fixierten Grenzen — kein `family`-Token.
#   Partition gemessen 2026-10-07: 154 = 31 auroral + 25 sub-auroral + 98 mid-latitude
#   (Artefakt state/river/gic-cgm-lat.tsv). Kanalkanal `magnetic_field_x_<code>` loest
#   ueber `field_sources` auf den station-qualifizierten Block auf.
#   Lauf: .github/workflows/field-te-query.yml Job `matrix-gic-auroral` (CI), nie lokal.
matrix gic_auroral full
register sources
channels magnetic_field_x_abk,magnetic_field_x_ale,magnetic_field_x_blc,magnetic_field_x_brw,magnetic_field_x_cbb,magnetic_field_x_cmo,magnetic_field_x_csy,magnetic_field_x_ded,magnetic_field_x_dmc,magnetic_field_x_drv,magnetic_field_x_fcc,magnetic_field_x_gdh,magnetic_field_x_hrn,magnetic_field_x_iqa,magnetic_field_x_jco,magnetic_field_x_kir,magnetic_field_x_lyc,magnetic_field_x_maw,magnetic_field_x_mbc,magnetic_field_x_mcq,magnetic_field_x_mea,magnetic_field_x_naq,magnetic_field_x_pbq,magnetic_field_x_res,magnetic_field_x_sba,magnetic_field_x_sod,magnetic_field_x_thl,magnetic_field_x_tik,magnetic_field_x_vna,magnetic_field_x_vos,magnetic_field_x_ykc
cond none
fdr bh 0.05 over matrix
expect cells 930
lags 0,1
surrogate 10
cadence live
bin 86400
seasonal none
